          "hex": "#1b1a1e"
        }
      },
      "$description": "Warm neutral ramp, 100 (lightest) to 900 (darkest). Warm grey rather than the marketing site's cool slate: the surfaces carry the calm, which lets the accent stay saturated without shouting."
