          "colorSpace": "srgb",
          "components": [
            0.1804,
            0.1294,
            0.4392
          ],
          "hex": "#2e2170"
        }
      },
      "$description": "Lilac accent. The ramp has no 500: the base accent is its own primitive (accent.base), mode-aware because each theme takes the value where it measures strongest. This is the two-layer resolution of the missing-500 wrinkle.",
      "base": {
        "$type": "color",
        "$value": {
          "colorSpace": "srgb",
          "components": [
            0.7961,
            0.7412,
            0.9686
          ],
          "hex": "#cbbdf7"
        },
        "$description": "Base accent primitive. Airy lilac on dark (10.03:1) and deeper violet on light (6.36:1) — calibrated up from the marketing site accent, which fails AA in both themes.",
        "$extensions": {
          "mode": {
            "dark": {
              "colorSpace": "srgb",
              "components": [
                0.7961,
                0.7412,
                0.9686
              ],
              "hex": "#cbbdf7"
            },
            "light": {
              "colorSpace": "srgb",
              "components": [
                0.3569,
                0.2471,
                0.7686
              ],
              "hex": "#5b3fc4"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "status": {
      "$description": "Status primitives, mode-aware: each theme needs a different lightness to hold AA as text. Kept fully saturated on purpose — with a calm surface set, state is what earns colour.",
      "success": {
